Package: scDonorAudit
Title: Audit Donor Influence in Single-Cell Pseudobulk Analyses
Version: 0.99.8
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Fuhao",
    family = "Jiang",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "emr39515@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-8836-8494"))
Description: Audits sample and donor design for two-condition single-cell
    pseudobulk differential expression analyses. Fits an edgeR quasi-likelihood
    model to each cell type and repeats the analysis after omitting each donor.
    Links planned donor omissions to design checks, fit outcomes and observed
    gene-effect changes. Provides descriptive summaries of donor-deletion
    sensitivity together with the coverage of valid effects.
